<!doctype html><html lang="my"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>My Profile | Innocreation ERP</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/workspace.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/profile.css"></head><body class="app-home"><header class="app-header"><a class="app-logo" href="/dashboard">INNOCREATION <span>/ ERP</span></a><div class="account-area"><% if(typeof user!=='undefined'&&Array.isArray(user.app_access)&&user.app_access.includes('inventory')){ %><%- include('partials/approval-notifications',{user,csrf}) %><% } %><a class="back-link" href="/dashboard">← Main Dashboard</a><form method="post" action="/logout"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="logout">Logout</button></form></div></header>
<main class="profile-workspace"><p class="eyebrow">PERSONAL WORKSPACE</p><div class="profile-heading"><div><h1>My Profile</h1><p class="muted">သင့်အကောင့်အချက်အလက်နှင့် Password ကို စီမံရန်။</p></div><span class="profile-role"><%= profile.role.split('_').map(s=>s.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+s.slice(1)).join(' ') %></span></div>
<div class="profile-layout"><section class="profile-info"><div class="profile-identity"><span class="profile-avatar" aria-hidden="true"><%= Array.from(profile.display_name||profile.username)[0] %></span><div><h2><%= profile.display_name %></h2><span><%= profile.username %></span></div></div><p class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT DETAILS</p><div class="profile-details"><div><label for="staff-name">Staff Name</label><input id="staff-name" value="<%= profile.display_name %>" readonly></div><div><label for="user-name">User Name</label><input id="user-name" value="<%= profile.username %>" readonly></div><div><label for="position">Position</label><input id="position" value="<%= profile.position||'မသတ်မှတ်ရသေးပါ' %>" readonly></div><div><label for="role">User Role</label><input id="role" value="<%= profile.role.split('_').map(s=>s.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+s.slice(1)).join(' ') %>" readonly></div></div><p class="profile-note">အကောင့်အချက်အလက်များကို Admin မှ သတ်မှတ်ပေးပါသည်။ ပြင်ဆင်လိုပါက Admin ကို ဆက်သွယ်ပါ။</p></section>
<section class="profile-password"><p class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT SECURITY</p><h2>Change Password</h2><p class="muted">လက်ရှိ Password ကို အတည်ပြုပြီး အသစ်ပြောင်းနိုင်ပါသည်။</p><% if(error){ %><div class="error" role="alert"><%= error %></div><% } %><form method="post" action="/profile/password"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="username" autocomplete="username" value="<%= profile.username %>"><label for="current-password">Current Password</label><input id="current-password" name="current_password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="••••••••••••" maxlength="256" required><p class="profile-field-note">လက်ရှိ Password အမှန်ကို ပြန်ရိုက်ပါ။ စာလုံးများကို ဖုံးထားပေးပါမည်။</p><label for="new-password">Change Password — Password အသစ်</label><input id="new-password" name="new_password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="5" maxlength="256" placeholder="အနည်းဆုံး ၅ လုံး" required><label for="confirm-password">Confirm New Password</label><input id="confirm-password" name="confirm_password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="5" maxlength="256" placeholder="Password အသစ်ကို ထပ်ရိုက်ပါ" required><div class="profile-password-footer"><p>ပြောင်းလဲပြီးလျှင် Password အသစ်ဖြင့် Login ပြန်ဝင်ရပါမည်။</p><button type="submit">Save New Password →</button></div></form></section></div></main></body></html>
